      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait dvt? thats kind of scary lol. i mean i've heard of it but it's probably not that serious right? im mostly just super tired and it's hard to catch my breath because of the jet lag and the dry plane air. i have some ibuprofen here and a bunch of water, can i just take some meds and sleep it off for a few hours to see if it gets better? i really dont want to go to the er at this hour if i can help it.",
